## Cloud agent habit

1. Use Insight IDs + Knowledge Editorial layout in **git only**.
2. Log every asset in `04-Content-Tracker/Siya-Content-Tracker.csv`.
3. Follow SIYA-STANDARDS CTAs (no Meet & Greet).
4. Do **not** invent `zoho-common/` or write to fake TrueSync paths on Linux.
5. Commit/PR so EOD fuse can pick it up.

## Local EOD habit

1. Paste master prompt from `brand/EOD-LOCAL-FUSE-MASTER-PROMPT.md`.
2. Run `bash apps/siya-health/brand/scripts/eod-fuse-to-truesync.sh`.
3. Merge tracker CSV rows into `Siya-Content-Tracker.xlsx` if that is the live sheet.

Git = code + editorial staging. WorkDrive Common Folder = team deliverables after fuse.

Do not sync secrets, `.env`, or the full monorepo into WorkDrive.

